{
  "bookId": "hero-214105",
  "id": "bond-43806",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43806001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "本仙知道，这些日子你定是在筹划什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "清池绿树，云雾缭绕……竟是一处小型洞府？这雾气是从何而来？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43806004",
              "text": "在周围铺了一层干冰。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43806004",
              "text": "科学的力量，很神奇吧？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43806003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "不愧是你。真是颇具巧思，本仙很中意。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女这瞧瞧，那看看，没多久便逛遍了整个洞府。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "看得出来你花了不少心思，但在本仙眼中，里面还缺了一样最重要的事物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43806008",
              "text": "还缺了什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43806007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "那便是——你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "若是你不能同本仙一起住在洞府里头，再好的景致终究也会变得无趣，就像本仙看待仙界的琼楼玉宇一般。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43806011",
              "text": "这个洞府是手办尺寸的。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43806011",
              "text": "人类可住不进去。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43806010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "嘻，只是几句笑言，莫要当真。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "你住不进来，本仙难道不会跑出来陪你么？我们还能一起做许多许多的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43806014",
              "text": "比如打铁花？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43806013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "比如打铁花。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "哎，自从到了你这，本仙的思凡之心愈发深重。长此以往，怕是回不了天上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43806017",
              "text": "那就一直留在我身边吧。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43806016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43806017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "暂且……依你便是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
